                "entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                "word": "je-m’en-foutisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "233d621c-3c3f-4277-afd3-163448d5c1c8",
                        "entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "je-m’en-foutismes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3f3d0a9e-c79e-4746-9f8e-9f524dd1020d",
                        "entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "j’ m’enfoutisme"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                        "entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Attitude de celui qui ne manifeste aucun intérêt, aucune compassion envers quoi que ce soit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7336ebd8-4bc4-493a-9366-35bbf9ca3d44",
                                "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                                "text": "En revanche, s’il est séquestré et malmené par l’indifférence et le je-m’en-foustisme, ce qui paraît le plus probable, le manque paralysant d’intérêt, le fait qu’il soit incapable d’attirer l’attention de quiconque : comment devrait-il faire pour se dépêtrer de la vase visqueuse qui l’environne, alors qu’il n’y a pas une seule branche à attraper, un seul point fixe où poser les pieds ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d857104-47f6-47ae-9931-8b4602cfe2d1",
                                "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                                "text": "L’adolescent affecte la même pose qu’il affichait lors de visites précédentes : un mélange de « je-m’en-foutisme » et de lassitude qui, le père le sait bien, n’est habituellement que façade orgueilleuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c886bdf-8077-49fb-893c-31acbaa74a59",
                                "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                                "text": "Le je-m’en-foutisme législatif, ça peut être compté dans les violences faites aux femmes ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dff0855a-a47b-4bf8-9d3c-a525b8287792",
                                "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                                "text": "Il n’y avait pas en elle cette légèreté, ce je-m’en foutisme qui étaient les miens lorsque j’étudiais à l’Agro."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3112c55-8fcd-44ce-ac87-67295a63cce3",
                                "sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                                "text": "J’aimerais que tu fasses preuve de moins de je-m’en-foutisme dans la gestion de ta vie privée."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "641debcd-8c13-42a2-9990-2a26a474a351",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                        "source_sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "indifference",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indifference",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8211dc7b-db8d-3724-99de-b6801dc58e8e",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being indifferent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d345c28b-656b-4d8a-8a21-7e08bc97b6b4",
                                                "sense_id": "8211dc7b-db8d-3724-99de-b6801dc58e8e",
                                                "text": "\"I do not care for them; I would not have them now,\" cried Lady Penrhyn; \"it is only your affection I care for. Do not suppose, for a moment, that I wish for the tables when you do not: oh, no! my only concern was for your indifference. But I am content if you tell me I was mistaken.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a27db88c-7273-307a-8052-46118583ce1b",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unbiased impartiality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de990e00-d921-3dc4-9660-7bec3d0ef936",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unemotional apathy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe74535a-2673-4243-b1ba-a0c645804ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "de990e00-d921-3dc4-9660-7bec3d0ef936",
                                                "text": "His daughter's indifference towards the sexist group made him wonder if she felt no empathy for the bullied."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59bc99c5-eb46-4f3c-b268-f80e9563c626",
                                                "sense_id": "de990e00-d921-3dc4-9660-7bec3d0ef936",
                                                "text": "I wish the consequences of this moment for young women punctured the apparent indifference of so many men and boys I saw that day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f444eaa-e3f2-3a51-aa04-1b3a0d65594b",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lack of enthusiasm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc199469-40a1-3131-9fcc-60afdb8c26b5",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unconcerned nonchalance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24b5fe27-4d36-434c-8cad-fdf51614a63c",
                                                "sense_id": "bc199469-40a1-3131-9fcc-60afdb8c26b5",
                                                "text": "I liked the man for his own sake, and even had he promised to turn out a celebrity it would have had no weight with me. I look upon notoriety with the same indifference as on the buttons on a man's shirt-front, or the crest on his note-paper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f9ba4cb-8ccf-3405-b6f5-330befd59489",
                                        "entry_id": "d92e49a0-4684-3b70-9265-2ca54d9c48b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Self-identity defined through the negation of difference, non-difference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c41dda57-14d0-4802-9f64-925669bf2cc3",
                                                "sense_id": "9f9ba4cb-8ccf-3405-b6f5-330befd59489",
                                                "text": "\"I call reason absolute reason, or reason insofar as it is conceived as the total indifference of the subjective and objective.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ccf9609-fa3e-48ac-8b2d-a40a19f9caf8",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c871da7-6aeb-3028-89d7-fecacb4ed5fe",
                        "source_sense_id": "d03abb4c-5820-3630-83fe-1ab9d6a2be5b",
